{"sha": "e797feea269a2e3ad4dd4e2dababdf033f96d2d81578f4a938e728e8bbe70c9c", "body": ["\\textbf{18.} 取 $t = \\sin^2\\theta$，$\\dd t =", "2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\\,\\dd\\theta$ 且 $t^{-1/2}(1-t)^{-1/2} =", "\\frac1{\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}$：", "\\[", "B\\Bigl(\\frac12, \\frac12\\Bigr) =", "\\int_0^{\\pi/2}2\\,\\dd\\theta = \\pi", "= \\frac{\\Gamma(\\frac12)^2}{\\Gamma(1)}", "\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad", "\\Gamma\\Bigl(\\frac12\\Bigr) = \\sqrt\\pi .", "\\]", "第一部分通过对参数求导，并使两个函数各自趋于极限，", "同样求得了这一常数；这里仅凭凸性便将问题固定下来，", "直至只剩一个值。", "以运动为手段的分析与以形状为手段的分析之对照。", "", "\\textbf{19.} $g(1) = \\frac{2^0}{\\sqrt\\pi}\\Gamma(\\frac12)", "\\Gamma(1) = 1$。递推关系：", "\\[", "g(x+1) = \\frac{2^{x}}{\\sqrt\\pi}\\,", "\\Gamma\\Bigl(\\frac{x+1}2\\Bigr)\\Gamma\\Bigl(\\frac x2 + 1\\Bigr)", "= \\frac{2^{x}}{\\sqrt\\pi}\\cdot\\frac x2\\,", "\\Gamma\\Bigl(\\frac x2\\Bigr)\\Gamma\\Bigl(\\frac{x+1}2\\Bigr)", "= x\\,g(x) .", "\\]", "对数凸性：$\\eu^{(x-1)\\log2}$（对数仿射）与", "对数凸函数 $\\Gamma$ 的两个仿射重参数化之积。", "玻尔--莫勒鲁普给出 $g = \\Gamma$；取 $x = 2z$：", "$\\Gamma(2z) = \\frac{2^{2z-1}}{\\sqrt\\pi}\\Gamma(z)\\Gamma(z +", "\\frac12)$.", "", "\\textbf{20.} 由 $\\Gamma(\\frac12) = \\sqrt\\pi$ 及递推关系，", "recursion, $\\Gamma(n + \\frac12) = (n - \\frac12)(n -", "\\frac32)\\cdots\\frac12\\,\\sqrt\\pi =", "\\frac{(2n-1)(2n-3)\\cdots1}{2^n}\\sqrt\\pi =", "\\frac{(2n)!}{4^nn!}\\sqrt\\pi$（用偶数补全", "奇数乘积）。渐近估计：由第 14 题，取 $g = \\log\\Gamma$", "及 $x = \\frac12$，可得 $\\sqrt{n-1} \\leq", "\\frac{\\Gamma(n+\\frac12)}{\\Gamma(n)} \\leq \\sqrt n$，于是", "该比值与 $\\sqrt n$ 之商夹在 $\\sqrt{1 - \\frac1n}$", "与 $1$ 之间。", "", "\\textbf{21.} 由第 20 题，$(2n)! =", "\\frac{4^nn!}{\\sqrt\\pi}\\Gamma(n + \\tfrac12)$，于是", "\\[", "\\binom{2n}n = \\frac{(2n)!}{(n!)^2}", "= \\frac{4^n\\,\\Gamma(n+\\frac12)}{\\sqrt\\pi\\;n!}", "= \\frac{4^n}{\\sqrt\\pi}\\cdot", "\\frac{\\Gamma(n+\\frac12)}{n\\,\\Gamma(n)}", "\\sim \\frac{4^n}{\\sqrt\\pi}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt n}{n}", "= \\frac{4^n}{\\sqrt{\\pi n}} .", "\\]", "数值上，$4^{10}/\\sqrt{10\\pi} = 1048576/5.6050 \\approx", "187078.6$，与 $\\binom{20}{10} = 184756$ 相比：比值为 $0.9876$", "--- 误差为 $O(1/n)$，在 $n = 10$ 时即已可见。", "", "\\textbf{22.} 等价关系：$\\Gamma(\\frac12) = \\sqrt\\pi", "\\Leftrightarrow G = \\sqrt\\pi$（第 3 题的代换 $x = u^2$", "）$\\Leftrightarrow B(\\frac12, \\frac12) = \\pi$", "（欧拉公式）；在 $z = n$ 时的倍元公式\\emph{就是}", "$\\Gamma(n + \\frac12)$ 的闭形式，而它\\emph{恰是}", "在斜率引理的意义下的中心二项式系数估计。参数技巧", "（第一、二部分）用于计算运动量的极限，", "且在确有真正形变存在时不可或缺（狄利克雷积分", "没有凸性证明）；凸性技巧", "本身不算出任何东西，却禁止一切", "--- 它擅长唯一性问题与函数方程", "（高斯、欧拉、勒让德三笔即可），而求导", "则会淹没于计算之中。一位完整的", "分析学家两者兼用。", "", "\\textbf{23.} 取 $t = \\sin^2\\theta$，$\\dd t =", "2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\\,\\dd\\theta =", "2\\,t^{1/2}(1-t)^{1/2}\\,\\dd\\theta$，于是", "\\[", "W_p = \\int_0^1 t^{p/2}\\,", "\\frac{\\dd t}{2\\,t^{1/2}(1-t)^{1/2}}", "= \\frac12\\int_0^1 t^{\\frac{p+1}2 - 1}(1-t)^{\\frac12 - 1}\\dd t", "= \\frac12\\,B\\Bigl(\\frac{p+1}2, \\frac12\\Bigr).", "\\]", "由贝塔函数的递推关系，取 $x = \\frac{n+1}2$，$y = \\frac12$", "可得", "\\[", "W_{n+2} = \\frac12\\,", "\\frac{(n+1)/2}{(n+2)/2}\\,B\\Bigl(\\frac{n+1}2, \\frac12\\Bigr)", "= \\frac{n+1}{n+2}\\,W_n .", "\\]", "由 $W_0 = \\frac\\pi2$，$W_1 = 1$ 出发：", "\\[", "W_{2n} = \\frac\\pi2\\prod_{k=1}^n\\frac{2k-1}{2k},", "\\qquad", "W_{2n+1} = \\prod_{k=1}^n\\frac{2k}{2k+1} .", "\\]", "由于 $\\sin^{n+1} \\leq \\sin^n$ 在 $\\intcc0{\\pi/2}$ 上成立，", "数列 $(W_n)$ 单调不增，于是", "\\[", "1 \\geq \\frac{W_{2n+1}}{W_{2n}} \\geq", "\\frac{W_{2n+1}}{W_{2n-1}} = \\frac{2n}{2n+1}", "\\longrightarrow 1 .", "\\]", "但由闭形式可得", "\\[", "\\frac{W_{2n+1}}{W_{2n}} = \\frac2\\pi", "\\prod_{k=1}^n\\frac{(2k)^2}{(2k-1)(2k+1)}", "= \\frac2\\pi\\prod_{k=1}^n\\frac{4k^2}{4k^2-1},", "\\]", "令 $n \\to \\infty$，即得沃利斯乘积。（经", "欧拉公式，$W_p = \\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}2\\,", "\\Gamma(\\frac{p+1}2)/\\Gamma(\\frac p2 + 1)$：沃利斯公式", "不过是高斯积分换了另一副面孔。）", ""]}